Ghostty
-------

https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty

`agterm-vt` is Ghostty's terminal (`src/terminal`, `src/input`, `src/terminfo`, `src/unicode` and the support
modules they use) at the revision `build/pins.env` pins as `LIBGHOSTTY_VT_REV`, by way of rustty (below). Other
modules that port Ghostty's code cite the Ghostty file and revision they follow.

