rustty
------

https://github.com/AirelyDev/rustty

`agterm-vt`'s code was taken from rustty, a Zig-to-Rust port of Ghostty, at the commit `build/pins.env` pins as
`RUSTTY_REV`, then trimmed to what agterm uses, reworked and brought to agterm's Ghostty revision.

